 "description": "Everything a page says about itself: title, description, OpenGraph/Twitter card, canonical, favicon, language, RSS/Atom feeds, JSON-LD schema types, headings \u2014 and link-preview problems. Use to build link previews, check SEO/social cards, find a site's feeds or structured data. Flags missing og:image, missing description and non-absolute image URLs (common reasons a link shows up bare on X/Telegram). When to use: For title/OpenGraph/canonical; for the article text use web_read. Price: $0.001 per call (10 free/day; after that a payment-required result lists x402 options). Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
